    {'id': 'math-ch6_10_g15_7', 'topic': '도형', 'stage': 5, 'prompt': '[경시대회] 그림처럼 정삼각형 2개를 겹쳐 놓았어요. 선분 ㄱㄹ이 선분 ㄹㄴ의 2배이고 ㄱㄷ이 84cm일 때, 사각형 ㄱㄹㅁㄷ의 둘레는 몇 cm일까요?', 'hint': '답을 직접 입력해 주세요.', 'explain': 'ㄱㄴ=84이니 ㄹㄴ=28, ㄱㄹ=56. ㄹㅁ=ㄴㅁ=28, ㅁㄷ=56. 둘레 = 56+28+56+84 = 224cm!', 'figure': '<svg viewBox="0 0 390 340" width="330" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">\n        <line x1="160" y1="30" x2="95" y2="305" stroke="#2a2a2a" stroke-width="2.5"/><line x1="95" y1="305" x2="320" y2="210" stroke="#2a2a2a" stroke-width="2.5"/><line x1="320" y1="210" x2="160" y2="30" stroke="#2a2a2a" stroke-width="2.5"/><line x1="117" y1="213" x2="170" y2="273" stroke="#2a2a2a" stroke-width="2.5"/>\n        <path d="M 166 44 Q 280 90 314 200" fill="none" stroke="#8a8072" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="5 5"/>\n        <text x="255" y="118" font-size="16" font-weight="900" fill="#5b5248" font-family="inherit">84 cm</text>\n        <text x="152" y="22" font-size="18" font-weight="900" fill="#312a35" font-family="inherit">ㄱ</text><text x="85" y="327" font-size="18" font-weight="900" fill="#312a35" font-family="inherit">ㄴ</text><text x="332" y="216" font-size="18" font-weight="900" fill="#312a35" font-family="inherit">ㄷ</text><text x="93" y="217" font-size="18" font-weight="900" fill="#312a35" font-family="inherit">ㄹ</text><text x="164" y="295" font-size="18" font-weight="900" fill="#312a35" font-family="inherit">ㅁ</text>\n      </svg>', 'type': 'input', 'answers': ['224'], 'playable': True},
